Usage terms

The materials in this repository are provided for anonymous peer review and scholarly replication. Code and derived non-restricted materials may be used to inspect, reproduce, and extend the empirical workflow, subject to the access conditions of the original CLDS and FOBS data providers.

Restricted household- or person-level microdata are not redistributed in this repository and must be obtained from the original providers. No warranty is provided.

Please cite the published article or repository record if these materials are used after publication.
